me they  see the sea in their life they don't  know how to swim so it's obvious that so  many lives are lost at sea  obviously that's only a short-term  solution and it's not the only solution  the long-term solution is international  development aid is the democratization  of countries in Africa and most  definitely is the securitization of  Libya and that's where we play a role as  a small country which is very near to  Libya culturally and geographically we  try to get as many tribes as possible  together in order for them to get around  having a national unity government or a  semblance of national Nutini unity  government in order then for them to ask  if necessary international help to  securitize the country prime minister  Joseph Muscat of Malta thank you very  much indeed for joining us
 

